Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:22.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宇宙海盗哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:39.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前车的车子请靠边停下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.33,0:01:40.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察找我有什么事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.01,0:01:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照我说的做，请停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.97,0:01:44.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.65,0:01:46.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是奉公守法的市民
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.73,0:01:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是拿你没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.63,0:01:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想以无视银河警察警告罪名而被罚款七百万吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开玩笑了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:57.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真温柔，哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.57,0:02:29.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是老样子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.25,0:02:31.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经把我给忘了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.81,0:02:34.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太遗憾了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:35.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.07,0:02:40.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第十六话 通向地狱的拉古球！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.05,0:02:47.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是银河警察要来抓我的话？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.45,0:02:50.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来这里不是来抓你的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.45,0:02:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不记得我们之间有过要约会的约定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:57.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实是…有件事想请你帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.17,0:03:00.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去打拉古球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.41,0:03:12.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红白两点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.07,0:03:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吧，美式足球和棒球改良后的拉古球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:17.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是力量激撞的格斗技
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:24.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,规则和棒球一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是捕到的球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.53,0:03:29.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是用来封杀跑者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.69,0:03:32.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是用来揍倒跑者 所以不限垒包
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.17,0:03:40.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为过于激烈，不时有人死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.97,0:03:45.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是也是现在最刺激最受欢迎的运动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:53.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红白红，完美，五点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:58.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不是叫你白做的\N事成之后就把你以前的犯罪记录一笔勾消
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.49,0:04:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这笔交易我不接受
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.65,0:04:01.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不合我的胃口
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:04.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早知道你会这么说…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:09.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么这样吧…外加现金二百万
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,银河警察竟然会想付这么一大笔钱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是很重要的案件吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.73,0:04:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这要一举毁掉基尔顿主要收入来源的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.77,0:04:27.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会答应的吧，哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶尔和男人玩玩也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:35.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,况且又是美人的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:39.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:43.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是营养餐口感也是很重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.49,0:04:48.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是刚才所说的拉鲁星的兰道竞技场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:54.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光是红色萨克逊这样的队伍就有一万名的选手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.33,0:04:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为死伤者众多的运动算是正常现像吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.41,0:05:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这队伍和基尔顿的毒品买卖有关
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至于路线就不懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以银河警察想要推荐你做选手\N然后加入红色萨克逊，查出毒品贩卖的路线
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过还有个问题…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:19.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如你所见拉鲁星位于银河警察的势力外\N也就是说他们拥有法外自治权
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:24.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而拉古球比赛的收入是那个星球唯一的收入来源\N可是那里就是个可是说是一个都市国家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦进入那里就像是进入了一个国家\N连银河警察也没有权利干涉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.37,0:05:30.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且入队后的第一年是严禁外出的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.65,0:05:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果逃走的话便会被干掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.77,0:05:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太吓人乐！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.37,0:05:38.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道路线后怎么通知你？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.25,0:05:40.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是选择你的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:44.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你想办法自己逃出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.45,0:05:45.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.29,0:05:48.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂刚才的治疗耳朵的药到哪里去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.97,0:05:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了解！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.21,0:05:52.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在全速飞往拉鲁星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:05.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脱离超高速飞行空间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:08.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就进入拉鲁星引力圈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.65,0:06:27.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是银河警察的多明尼克中尉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:31.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带来上回提到的自愿入团者乔·基里安
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:34.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是乔·基里安，怎么样是个好名字吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.37,0:06:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请多指教了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.57,0:06:38.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选手登陆号码 N303
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.35,0:06:39.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,检查完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.61,0:06:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明尼克中尉，请离开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选手请到里面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来带路，请…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.81,0:06:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.17,0:06:52.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.17,0:06:55.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今年的新人奖和MVP是我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.77,0:07:05.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选手登记号N303
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:07.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身体检查完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.97,0:07:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戒备这么森严
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:15.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好别起逃亡的念头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至今没有半个人成功过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.17,0:07:19.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.61,0:07:21.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟监狱很像啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是银河冠军的红色萨克逊队 真是豪华啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.97,0:07:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有酒又有美女，太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.41,0:07:37.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂！新人，你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.47,0:07:38.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里？就是那里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:40.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里是一军的居住区
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:42.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新人要先进二军
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二军啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:45.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一军的条件这么好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.17,0:07:47.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里可是够阴暗的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:03.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去是可以 但是不要妨碍我练习
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.73,0:08:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就无法过去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就走别路吧 不然爬过去也行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.25,0:08:14.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,队长，别再为难他了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.17,0:08:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是向他问候一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.65,0:08:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我可以走了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.17,0:08:24.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:32.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.61,0:08:42.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗恩选手！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.41,0:08:44.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗恩！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.19,0:08:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是新人乔基里安选手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:49.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天起和你同室 请好好照顾下他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.85,0:08:54.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这房间真是烂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只烂还满是灰尘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:05.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:07.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死人的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.89,0:09:09.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫乔是不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.09,0:09:10.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是忘了什么事情？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.37,0:09:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问候啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.27,0:09:15.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问候啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.37,0:09:17.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊，请多指教了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:18.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.13,0:09:20.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该说请多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:22.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天再讲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.87,0:09:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是哪里出身的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.21,0:09:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,银河警察
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.93,0:09:30.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.77,0:09:31.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:35.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上回有个叫巴托的也是你们银河警察推荐的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:39.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴托巴顿正好也睡在你这张床上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴托啊 我知道那个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个家伙怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.05,0:09:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还不知道他怎样啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.17,0:09:49.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是被银河警察给掩盖起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.49,0:09:53.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死了 在练习中脖子被扭断
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,银河警察的人真是没用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有枪法比较好而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.27,0:10:03.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却没有选手应有的格斗技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.01,0:10:09.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也千万保重这条命
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.85,0:10:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来他只有胆量过人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.81,0:10:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在练了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.29,0:10:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也加入好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的问候很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:45.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.77,0:10:47.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还算不错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.57,0:10:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过难得的练习被中断了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.45,0:10:53.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的手还很不满
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.25,0:10:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样对身体不好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:10:59.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样陪我玩玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:01.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.21,0:11:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想早点适应红色萨克逊队的环境啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.37,0:11:07.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情变得有意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.17,0:11:08.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赌队长50元
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.97,0:11:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赌队长40元
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.33,0:11:11.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赌队长60元
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.65,0:11:13.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赌队长80元
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:15.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赌队长70元
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.41,0:11:18.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋，这样根本就不算赌博
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.69,0:11:23.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好，我守第一线
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.45,0:11:25.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你突破看看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.97,0:11:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.09,0:11:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家听着，不准有人插手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.85,0:11:33.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.01,0:11:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要想得太简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.41,0:11:36.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我连这东西都不需要了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个蠢货，连护具都不要了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.13,0:11:45.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是死了可别怪我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.49,0:12:11.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得好 队长
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个臭屁走狗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:16.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧 你没死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:19.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不自量力就是指你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:22.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在整理好行李去找妈妈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.21,0:12:24.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的话还能赶上末班车
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:32.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诸君的话我全听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怪…怪物，竟然还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:37.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是被撞到而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.21,0:12:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们队长才可怜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.53,0:12:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是场受益多多的训练
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.25,0:12:55.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.65,0:12:57.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然把我们的队长…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.97,0:13:43.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了，得手了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:45.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.01,0:13:48.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看看，手都变红了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.29,0:13:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.21,0:13:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看那个巴托巴顿选手不是在球场\N而是在床上被扭脖子死的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是，不是我干的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.17,0:14:00.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因…因为他是好选手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好选手都会被扭脖子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这个原因
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.09,0:14:09.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么原因？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.09,0:14:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里的每个人都是竞争对手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.61,0:14:19.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少一个人就多一分上球场的机会\N说不定就这样有机会升上一军了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:23.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再偷袭你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:27.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原谅我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.17,0:14:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:30.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:37.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来，乔，你的手是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.17,0:14:39.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和常人不同
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.05,0:14:42.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的金钢手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.73,0:14:53.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肚子饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:56.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人只有吃是最大享受了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.41,0:15:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊，不好意思，失去平衡了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.61,0:15:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的脚！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:06.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.57,0:15:09.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你脚太长所以就不知不觉踩到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.69,0:15:11.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.93,0:15:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.89,0:15:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混帐！新人这么嚣张准备干什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.61,0:15:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的早餐！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.69,0:15:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.29,0:15:22.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.45,0:15:24.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要这么猛吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.37,0:15:26.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.53,0:15:35.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干掉他！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全员！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:11.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.47,0:16:14.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早餐时间已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.61,0:16:17.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这么惨！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毒品路线…到底要怎样找出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.25,0:16:27.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是太幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.45,0:16:30.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大老板想要接见你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.09,0:16:33.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,史要请我们免费看电影吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.73,0:16:35.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么傻话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.73,0:16:40.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是老板看中你的话 你就能升上一军了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一军吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:46.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是刚才那场乱斗让他们对你刮目相看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.37,0:16:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毒品的味道越来越浓了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.57,0:16:59.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带新人乔基里安来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.97,0:17:00.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.97,0:17:02.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔基里安
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.37,0:17:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由银河警察推荐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你似乎…大闹了一场呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.81,0:17:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里…小事一桩而已
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身高195cm 体重88Kg
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.09,0:17:14.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身材十分的标准啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.81,0:17:18.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我对自己的胸部和臀部没有什么自信
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.17,0:17:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很有胆色啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.89,0:17:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈里森，试试他有没有进入一军的实力？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.93,0:17:25.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗？老板
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.77,0:17:28.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想亲眼看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.77,0:17:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别出手太重
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.39,0:17:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还是个新人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.37,0:17:33.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.53,0:17:37.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你在银河警察中的名声很响亮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:38.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.77,0:17:44.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里可不同 不论是银河警察还是二军
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:46.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里可是迈向地狱的第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:49.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我捡下雪茄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.85,0:17:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到此为止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没用上就受伤的话 契约金会浪费掉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.05,0:18:05.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:08.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个欢迎方式确实不错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.73,0:18:09.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是社长
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.97,0:18:12.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的治疗费不是不会少
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:30.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太可怜了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.45,0:18:33.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这阵子恐怕是暂时是不能动了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.45,0:18:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙是人材
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.25,0:18:40.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才打倒队里的二垒手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.09,0:18:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天起你就可以进入一军
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭这种没用的二垒手也能得到冠军\N真是令人难以相信
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.13,0:18:59.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个选手怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.81,0:19:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,力量确实惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.77,0:19:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难怪老板会赞不绝口
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.97,0:19:06.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布拉德，我看你也技痒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.23,0:19:07.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.85,0:19:10.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我考虑让他做一垒手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.01,0:19:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说你的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你要和他争夺首发的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.73,0:19:20.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我期待着你们的较量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.49,0:19:24.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你失望的，老板
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:40.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.09,0:19:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.09,0:19:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是机器坏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.25,0:20:04.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它竟然自爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:22.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是遥控接收器
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.05,0:20:33.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好，不愧是银河系的冠军队
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.45,0:20:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啦啦队都是美女
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.53,0:20:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请走开
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.33,0:20:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么关系丰别这么冷淡嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:43.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就陪陪我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.49,0:20:44.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要！请让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米兰达！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.65,0:20:48.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:49.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.61,0:20:53.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下她，大块头
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.37,0:20:57.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说你们两个不怎么相配
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么看都是美女与野兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.49,0:21:00.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.77,0:21:02.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生面孔嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.85,0:21:04.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是走错房间了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.57,0:21:05.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是特别室
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.05,0:21:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.17,0:21:09.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一军选手才能进来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.65,0:21:11.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁没受伤前快滚回二军吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.65,0:21:12.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是一军
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.95,0:21:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是刚入队而已
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.57,0:21:15.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.33,0:21:16.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是那个乔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.39,0:21:18.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个让哈里森住进医院的乔吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为初次见面他太热情地招呼了我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:27.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新人居然这么猖狂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.45,0:21:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就代替他来修理你，把你的手都扭断
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.65,0:21:33.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也是这么进医院的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.13,0:21:34.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说大话的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.21,0:21:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停手吧，说不定你就会躺在那个家伙的旁边的床上了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.77,0:21:37.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.81,0:21:46.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀死你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.77,0:21:47.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手，吉尔多
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.01,0:21:50.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布拉德
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.97,0:22:01.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老板很中意他，不可以让他受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.45,0:22:02.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是丹布拉德
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.63,0:22:04.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是队里的一垒手以及队长
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.45,0:22:08.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是去年在比赛中令球员死伤最多的人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.29,0:22:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上个赛季被布拉德干掉的有十三人之多
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.88,0:22:13.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送入医院的不计其数
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:15.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也杀掉了七个人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔基里安，给你个忠告
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.09,0:22:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别做的太过分了，其他的队员可是会反感的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.25,0:22:27.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在竞技场以外的地方我可以阻止其他队员来杀你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.55,0:22:28.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是在比赛中的话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.55,0:22:30.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀人是无罪的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.77,0:22:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧，吉尔多
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.39,0:22:45.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉古球真是一种杀人的游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.86,0:22:47.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我眼前有人被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.66,0:22:49.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认为是一般比赛所以不是太在意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.89,0:22:51.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是比赛中杀意越来越浓
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.86,0:22:53.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真恐怖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:56.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由一军和二军进行比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.77,0:22:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是第二队的但不是我想加入的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.80,0:23:01.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么接着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.41,0:23:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一集\N卑鄙的队伍
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.77,0:23:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见面吧
